{"id":361,"slug":"361-partial-t-va-required-t-la-gi","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Utility Types","level":"beginner","question_vi":"`Partial<T>` và `Required<T>` là gì?","question_en":"What are `Partial<T>` and `Required<T>`?","answer_vi":"`Partial<T>` làm tất cả properties của T thành optional. `Required<T>` làm tất cả optional thành required. Cả hai chỉ shallow.\n\n```typescript\ninterface User { id: number; name: string; bio?: string }\n\n// Partial: dùng cho PATCH requests\nfunction updateUser(id: string, data: Partial<User>) { /* ... */ }\nupdateUser('1', { name: 'New Name' }); // OK, không cần gửi toàn bộ\n\n// Required: enforce tất cả fields sau validation\nconst validated: Required<User> = { id: 1, name: 'An', bio: 'Dev' };\n```","answer_en":"`Partial<T>` makes all properties of T optional. `Required<T>` makes all optional properties required. Both are shallow.\n\n```typescript\ninterface User { id: number; name: string; bio?: string }\n\n// Partial: used for PATCH requests\nfunction updateUser(id: string, data: Partial<User>) { /* ... */ }\nupdateUser('1', { name: 'New Name' }); // OK, no need to send everything\n\n// Required: enforce all fields after validation\nconst validated: Required<User> = { id: 1, name: 'An', bio: 'Dev' };\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code> làm tất cả properties của T thành optional. <code>Required&lt;T&gt;</code> làm tất cả optional thành required.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Cả hai chỉ shallow.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"interface User { id: number; name: string; bio?: string }\n\n// Partial: dùng cho PATCH requests\nfunction updateUser(id: string, data: Partial&lt;User&gt;) { /* ... */ }\nupdateUser('1', { name: 'New Name' }); // OK, không cần gửi toàn bộ\n\n// Required: enforce tất cả fields sau validation\nconst validated: Required&lt;User&gt; = { id: 1, name: 'An', bio: 'Dev' };\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">bio</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Partial: dùng cho PATCH requests</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">updateUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Partial</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>&gt;</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* ... */</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">updateUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;New Name&#x27;</span> }); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK, không cần gửi toàn bộ</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Required: enforce tất cả fields sau validation</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">validated</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Required</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>&gt; = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;An&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">bio</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Dev&#x27;</span> };</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code> makes all properties of T optional. <code>Required&lt;T&gt;</code> makes all optional properties required.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Both are shallow.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"interface User { id: number; name: string; bio?: string }\n\n// Partial: used for PATCH requests\nfunction updateUser(id: string, data: Partial&lt;User&gt;) { /* ... */ }\nupdateUser('1', { name: 'New Name' }); // OK, no need to send everything\n\n// Required: enforce all fields after validation\nconst validated: Required&lt;User&gt; = { id: 1, name: 'An', bio: 'Dev' };\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">bio</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Partial: used for PATCH requests</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">updateUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Partial</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>&gt;</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* ... */</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">updateUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;New Name&#x27;</span> }); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK, no need to send everything</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Required: enforce all fields after validation</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">validated</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Required</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>&gt; = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;An&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">bio</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Dev&#x27;</span> };</code></pre></div>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/321-typescript-la-gi-va-tai-sao-nen-dung-typescript-thay-javascript","title":"TypeScript là gì và tại sao nên dùng TypeScript thay JavaScript?"},{"url":"/q/322-type-annotation-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Type annotation trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/323-any-unknown-va-never-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"any, unknown và never khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/324-union-types-va-intersection-types-la-gi","title":"Union types và intersection types là gì?"},{"url":"/q/325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/327-type-narrowing-la-gi-cac-cach-narrow-type-trong-typescript","title":"Type narrowing là gì? Các cách narrow type trong TypeScript?"},{"url":"/q/328-as-keyword-type-assertion-la-gi-khi-nao-dung","title":"as keyword (type assertion) là gì? Khi nào dùng?"},{"url":"/q/329-non-null-assertion-operator-la-gi","title":"Non-null assertion operator (!) là gì?"}]}